cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.

title: "MTG — Mind the Gap"

abstract: >-
  MTG (Mind the Gap) is a platform designed to help educators review course
  materials and redesign teaching and assessment for the age of generative AI.
  It combines language-model-based document understanding with explicit
  pedagogical rules to produce traceable findings and improvement suggestions.

type: software

repository-code: "https://github.com/HISTLab-hevs/MTG"
